    "prompt": "Solve this question:\n\nWork to pump water (integrals): A cylindrical tank of radius 2 m is filled with water to a height of 5 m. Water must be pumped to a spout 1.5 m above the top of the tank. Compute the work required (in joules) assuming water density 1000 kg/m^3 and g=9.8 m/s^2.",
